[35m[3mcodex[0m[0m
Audited: **175/175 manifest rows**, definitions, class memberships, SRD descriptions, and KB entries.

### CRITICAL — 34 rows

- Wrong timing: `ray-of-frost`, `shocking-grasp` expire at the caster’s next turn rather than the target’s; `guiding-bolt` expires at the caster’s next turn start rather than end. See [definitions.ts](/home/vagrant/PhpstormProjects/dnd-wt-vtt/src/combat/spells/definitions.ts:176).
- Unsupported `willing:true`: `spare-the-dying`, `cure-wounds`, `healing-word`, `sanctuary`, `shield-of-faith`, `lesser-restoration`, `protection-from-poison`, `remove-curse`, `revivify`, `tongues`, `death-ward`, `greater-invisibility`. The cited SRD imposes no such restriction.
- False-full omissions: `fire-bolt` and `burning-hands` omit object ignition; `sacred-flame` omits cover bypass; `bane`, `magic-missile`, and `blindness-deafness` omit visibility requirements; `shield` omits its reaction trigger; `thunderwave` omits object push and its 300-foot boom.
- Other wrong semantics:

  - `elementalism`: invents a one-active-effect limit; its KB guidance repeats the unsupported rule.
  - `spare-the-dying`: fixes range at 30 feet, omitting 15/30/60/120-foot cantrip scaling.
  - `charm-person`: grants save Advantage unconditionally rather than only during hostile combat.
  - `grease`, `black-tentacles`: SRD ground squares are implemented as 3D cubes.
  - `darkness`: models level-2 light spells as suppressed; SRD says dispelled. KB repeats the error.
  - `web`, `zone-of-truth`: execute immediate cast-time saves absent from the SRD.
  - `bestow-curse`: slot 5+ duration/concentration regimes are replaced by linear round scaling.
  - `spirit-guardians`: allows either damage type without the SRD alignment restriction.
  - `resilient-sphere`: always saves; SRD saves only unwilling creatures.
  - `secret-chest`: stores a flat daily 5% risk instead of the cumulative daily chance; KB repeats the flat interpretation.

### MAJOR — 28 rows

Missing mechanics are not honestly declared in residuals:

`dancing-lights` (combined form/adjoining constraint), `light` (color/recast expiry), `mage-hand` (prohibited actions/recast expiry), `minor-illusion` (physical and sensory rules), `prestidigitation` (per-option durations), `thaumaturgy` (Intimidation Advantage), `alarm` (10-second audible alarm), `find-familiar` (spirit type, one-familiar/reform and no-attack rules), `hideous-laughter` (can’t self-end Prone), `jump` (willing target), `silent-image` (sensory/physical limitations), `unseen-servant` (Invisible/Medium/no-attack traits), `arcanists-magic-aura` (target eligibility), `enhance-ability` (Constitution exclusion), `silence` (claims Deafened support absent from payload), `spider-climb` (willing target), `clairvoyance` (sensor eligibility/intangible/invulnerable traits), `counterspell` (trigger qualification), `gaseous-form` (speech/object/liquid/space restrictions), `sending` (target identity qualification), `arcane-eye` (all-direction vision/hover/barrier rules), `control-water` (Whirlpool save/check abilities), `dimension-door` (willing passenger), `faithful-hound` (Small+ trigger and intangible/invulnerable traits), `guardian-of-faith` (invulnerability), `polymorph` (retained statistics), `stone-shape` (Medium-object constraint), `wall-of-fire` (solid-surface requirement).

### MINOR

- `aid`: residual says maximum-HP reduction awaits implementation, but effect expiry already removes the modifier.
- `alter-self`: “natural-weapon values persist” overstates the payload; damage types and spellcasting-ability substitution are absent.
- `floating-disk`: 1-inch thickness omitted.
- `identify`: residual says “creature spell lists”; SRD says ongoing spells affecting the creature.
- `divination`: definition and KB cite line 2313, but its header is line 2312.
- All **135 Wizard-membership rows** cite the current Wizard list exactly **219 lines late** (`acid-splash` cites 246; actual 27, through `wall-of-fire` 428; actual 209). Cleric locators are exact. The affected row IDs are precisely every manifest row containing `list: 'Wizard'`: 15 level-0, 30 level-1, 35 level-2, 29 level-3, and 26 level-4 rows.

### Verdict

**FAIL — increment 4 cannot close.** The manifest contains numerous wrong executable semantics and false-full claims, including systemic targeting, timing, save-trigger, and upcast errors.
